WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.375
A line crossing two parallel lines makes eight angles, in pairs.

2
00:00:05.375 --> 00:00:09.300
Corresponding angles are in the same place at each crossing.

3
00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:17.313
Alternate angles are between the lines, on opposite sides.

4
00:00:21.562 --> 00:00:25.462
Co-interior angles are between the lines, on the same side.
